              "China’s Official Manufacturing PMI Slides to 27-Month Low - All five subindexes fall in October, and gauge for new export orders falling for third straight month as trade war escalates\n\nCaixin\n\nOct 31, 2018 06:06 PM\n\nECONOMY",
